{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38910","headline":"下第寄池州郑员外 · 杜荀鹤","name":"下第寄池州郑员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"省出蓬蒿修谒初，蒙知曾不见生疎。\n侯门数处将书荐，帝里经年借宅居。\n未必有诗堪讽诵，祗怜无援过吹嘘。\n如今足得成持取，莫使江湖却钓鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}